<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v1.2 20190208//EN" "JATS-archivearticle1.dtd">
<article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="research-article">
  <front>
    <journal-meta>
      <journal-title-group><journal-title>Test Journal of Biochemistry</journal-title></journal-title-group>
    </journal-meta>
    <article-meta>
      <article-id pub-id-type="pmid">31043725</article-id>
      <article-id pub-id-type="pmc">6483969</article-id>
      <article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1234/tjb.2019.0042</article-id>
      <title-group><article-title>Kinase X inhibition reduces tumour growth in a mouse xenograft model</article-title></title-group>
      <contrib-group>
        <contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>Nara</given-names></name></contrib>
        <contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>Taeyoon</given-names></name></contrib>
        <contrib contrib-type="author"><collab>The Test Consortium</collab></contrib>
      </contrib-group>
      <pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>2</day><month>5</month><year>2019</year></pub-date>
      <abstract>
        <sec><title>Background</title><p>Kinase X is overexpressed in 62&nbsp;% of tumours.</p></sec>
        <sec><title>Results</title><p>Inhibitor KX-7 reduced tumour volume by 48.3% (<italic>p</italic> &lt; 0.001).</p></sec>
      </abstract>
    </article-meta>
  </front>
  <body>
    <sec id="s1">
      <label>1</label><title>Introduction</title>
      <p>Kinase X phosphorylates substrate Y <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="R1">[1]</xref>. Its K<sub>m</sub> is 2.5 &#x003bc;M and expression rises 10<sup>3</sup>-fold.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="s2">
      <label>2</label><title>Results</title>
      <sec id="s2.1">
        <label>2.1</label><title>KX-7 inhibits tumour growth</title>
        <p>Mice (n = 12 per group) received KX-7 &ndash; see <xref ref-type="fig" rid="F1">Figure 1</xref>.</p>
        <fig id="F1" position="float">
          <label>Figure 1</label>
          <caption><title>Tumour volume over time.</title><p>Mean &#xb1; SEM, n = 12.</p></caption>
          <graphic xlink:href="tjb-42-g001"/>
        </fig>
        <table-wrap id="T1">
          <label>Table 1</label>
          <caption><p>IC50 values.</p></caption>
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Compound</th><th>IC<sub>50</sub> (nM)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td>KX-7</td><td>14.2</td></tr><tr><td>Control</td><td>&gt;10,000</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
          <table-wrap-foot><p>Measured in triplicate.</p></table-wrap-foot>
        </table-wrap>
        <disp-formula id="E1"><label>(1)</label><alternatives><tex-math>V = \frac{L W^2}{2}</tex-math></alternatives></disp-formula>
      </sec>
    </sec>
  </body>
